   Setup

   Each line is a check. When one fails and kit knows the fix, choose now to run it or later to move on.

   ✅ bash 5.2 is installed
   ✅ git 2.47 is installed
 ▸ ❌ jq is not installed    now   later 
      brew install jq
   ❌ gh is not logged in to github.com
      gh auth login --hostname github.com · it needs you at the keyboard
   ❌ kit check finds 2 differences from the release
      read: kit help check













